    .string "I'm studying how certain mineral\n"
    .string "materials affect POKéMON evolution.\p"
    .string "One of our prototypes is ready for\n"
    .string "field testing.\p"
    .string "It's called a PROTECTOR.\p"
    .string "Take it. I'd like to know what happens\n"
    .string "when a Trainer uses it properly.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_ReceivedProtector::
